Repository: https://github.com/hashicorp/vault/tree/main/shamir
Full license text: internal/shamir/LICENSE

The files in internal/shamir/ are redistributed under MPL-2.0 and retain
their original license headers. They are NOT relicensed under this
project's MIT license. Under MPL-2.0 these files may be combined with the
rest of Riven (a "Larger Work") licensed under MIT, provided the MPL-2.0
