Standard library

The recipient key mechanisms come from the Go standard library and are
covered by the Go BSD-3-Clause license:

  crypto/hpke   Hybrid Public Key Encryption (RFC 9180), used for every
                recipient key type: X-Wing (ML-KEM-768 with X25519),
                ML-KEM-768, ML-KEM-1024, X25519, P-256 and P-384
  crypto/mlkem  ML-KEM (FIPS 203)
  crypto/ecdh   X25519 and the NIST curves
